om":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-14T10:21:19-07:00","id":1540366,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1540107-questions-about-the-new-york-setting-presented-in-tome-of-the-pentacle?p=1540292#post1540292\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/560-obsidian-pharaoh\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar560_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"560\" data-vbnamecard=\"560\">Obsidian Pharaoh</a> I know some of those are specified in Tome of the Pentacle, but would you know which books also reference the NPCs ?</div> </div> </div> </div>So, Carter and Locksmith are from the corebook fiction; Fern and Niniane are one-time, name-only mentions in the Fallen World Chronicle Anthology; Riley and Cade are from the opening fiction of Tome of the Pentacle; Aldin, John Welsh, Arabelle, and Zazu are from that summary I can't find anymore; and Shabbatai is the sample Kabbalah character from 1e's Magical Traditions who is from New York, hence his seemingly odd placement here. The rest (including other corebook fiction stars) are all mentioned in TotP.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":560,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/560-obsidian-pharaoh","user":"Obsidian Pharaoh","date":". 08-14-2024, 04:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"http